\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Yes. That synopsis contains several things that should have been carrying much more weight in the kit. In particular, it gives a 
\f1\b \strokec2 better reason for the scene to exist
\f0\b0 \strokec2  than some of the generic suspense machinery I added.\
