\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f0 Keep the venue 
\f1\b \strokec2 strongly Greek-themed
\f0\b0 \strokec2 .\
Greek food, drink, music, d\'e9cor, vessels, mythological/classical flourishes and the general cultural atmosphere are all useful.\
The correction is only not to stack every available Greek signifier into a giant flashing 
\f1\b \strokec2 ANCIENT PHILOSOPHERS
\f0\b0 \strokec2 joke.\
The venue should feel like somewhere the Sages might naturally enjoy themselves, and it can provide a credible cultural pathway into the later physical contest.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

