\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \strokec2 Chilo
\f0\b0 \strokec2  can be the most confident interpreter. Strange Kebab results may look to him like confirmation.\

\f1\b \strokec2 Kleo
\f0\b0 \strokec2  can be more inclined to trust empirical progress: something worked, something responded, something produced a result, therefore continuing may be justified.\

\f1\b \strokec2 Solo
\f0\b0 \strokec2  can increasingly worry that they are confusing:\
